WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.291
In one minute, you will find displays that a lighting company installed.

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:05.358
We start on the map.

00:00:06.259 --> 00:00:09.591
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.851
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:16.340
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.686
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:21.644
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:22.296
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:27.259
Tap the season button.

00:00:29.694 --> 00:00:31.807
Tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:33.612 --> 00:00:34.854
Tap Filters.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.412
Under Type, tap Professionally installed.

00:00:41.142 --> 00:00:43.534
Tap the red button to show the places.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.180
Open one.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.260
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:53.921
Tap the company's name to open its profile.

00:00:55.977 --> 00:01:01.864
This is the company's profile, with its area, phone, website, and the homes it has installed.

00:01:03.064 --> 00:01:05.653
Next up: Enter your home in a contest.
